{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_022_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:eee9e0f18ab772af0d09672992954b574d0f305bad8a9cb07f6e928c44108132",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317229e91d6ba6c45fca0754c38138394d350a2ce70fd3adb92a0ba939ef01dc",
      "text": "几个月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:286c5be8526864d02af7bec27e3fe2ccc3cb342c1da9f1bd2ba4834c96b8632f",
      "text": "夏来先生，辛苦了。\n前阵子的那本杂志，您已经看过了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adb630d551eda7da6203b50cb196f240dc9a9cfc32788c748dd2fe26bbfa1422",
      "text": "嗯……已经看过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5913bae34c8f67a77db7fc5ea2e00f5db82607f03eab5a2d56ff3d650345b24",
      "text": "隼人说看到就买下来了，\n带到了社团活动室……四季也是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2edd0de30fb7462d84fa251e6fa6c949179af2c997a753942f7263945086daac",
      "text": "这样啊！\n那么，是和大家一起看的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2766f665f9a5fb3202fc7cddd05d9efaab8100f0679b9adcc6e83fda1fd604a6",
      "text": "嗯。隼人和四季已经看过了……我和春名\n还有旬……一起看的。稍微，有点难为情……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9c2bc2ec3f33f2700a3277ac0536c4f28e15418da6ade4fdf44afea882aaa4f",
      "text": "四季说，采访内容很神秘……\n虽然我不是很懂……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4a64b9e99320681730c9ae47a6d6b954f01750e93812f84d2a3b04160ebd007",
      "text": "编辑部那边也说，访谈和照片的反差\n充满神秘感，好评如潮哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d59b7bbc31295b3a3f570d3472d9310e1e2e637d88eed215c7225e9fb60c118",
      "text": "这样啊……\n我只是和平常一样而已……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5e315349adfcb34e93bee7a904c757a75ca22623a3bf1e7fa01aff9eb78b1ce",
      "text": "那样的一面也是夏来先生的魅力所在！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87d6731722bb9a0c8190cf8781051f4feb28cfce0bcb11d10024ef2235402462",
      "text": "……是吗。既然●●●●プロデューサー都这么说了，\n那一定就是这样吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
